  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "The diverted earthly calamities and heavenly tribulations form the ten year blizzard that spreads across northern plains. When Imperial Court blessed land opens a crack in accordance with this Gu, calamities rush out and the setup that prevents Gu Immortals from entering is briefly ineffective.",
        "chapters": [
          567
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_imperial_court_blessed_land",
          "sys_gu_immortal"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Giant Sun’s will activates Divert Disaster Gu from True Yang Building. A light pillar shreds willow winds back into heaven qi and obliterates the lofty tiger earthly calamity. Onlookers name the rumored divert disaster Gu, and Hei Lou Lan wants that Immortal Gu because luck path Divert Disaster Gu can divert or obliterate heavenly tribulations and earthly calamities.",
        "chapters": [
          608
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "tai-bai-tribulation-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_hei_lou_lan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan classes it as a foundational piece of Eighty-Eight True Yang Building used so Imperial Court blessed land can divert disasters, and notes Giant Sun’s will will not sacrifice it lightly. A divert disaster light pillar surrounds Tai Bai Yun Sheng; the Gu is already full of cracks, and further reinforcement risks destroying it from backlash.",
        "chapters": [
          611
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "tai-bai-tribulation-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "char_tai_bai_yun_sheng"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "When the Gu hibernates, the blizzard calamity invades Imperial Court blessed land. Its standing use can turn calamities and tribulations into heaven qi and earth qi for the blessed land to absorb.",
        "chapters": [
          612
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "tai-bai-tribulation-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
