          "sys_gu_worms"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Hei Lou Lan names divert disaster Gu among the only three Immortal Gu still on Giant Sun’s will when she seizes them.",
        "chapters": [
          649
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "remaining-immortal-gu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "During Hei Lou Lan’s immortal ascension she fires divert disaster light through her eyes as an unfinished immortal killer move with Divert Disaster Immortal Gu as the core, then the Gu bursts and is destroyed.",
        "chapters": [
          685
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "remaining-immortal-gu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_immortal_ascension",
          "sys_killer_moves"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Lang Ya land spirit lists divert disaster Immortal Gu among Connect Luck and Break Luck as part of Giant Sun’s all living being’s luck true inheritance once held in Imperial Court blessed land.",
